1
00:04:09,000 --> 00:04:15,000
Secret Millionaire is a romance, tv movie film directed by Michael M. Scott.

2
00:08:18,000 --> 00:08:24,000
When a bored millionaire (Steve Lund) is mistaken for a parking attendant by a beautiful girl (Siobhan Williams) who is protesting
against his family’s intention of closing a local park, he uses the misunderstanding to get to know her better.

3
00:12:27,000 --> 00:12:33,000
Sean Payton, played by Steve Lund.

4
00:16:36,000 --> 00:16:42,000
Alisson, played by Siobhan Williams.

5
00:20:45,000 --> 00:20:51,000
Jared, played by Jaime M. Callica.

6
00:24:54,000 --> 00:25:00,000
Caden, played by Adam DiMarco.

7
00:29:03,000 --> 00:29:09,000
Candice, played by Elise Gatien.

8
00:33:12,000 --> 00:33:18,000
Joe Millionaire is an American reality television series
broadcast by the Fox Broadcasting Company (Fox).

9
00:37:21,000 --> 00:37:27,000
The series premiered on January 6, 2003, and concluded with the
finale of its second season on November 24, 2003.

10
00:41:30,000 --> 00:41:36,000
Both seasons followed a group of single women in
competition for the affection of a bachelor.

11
00:45:39,000 --> 00:45:45,000
The women were under the belief that the bachelor was a millionaire;
however, he was actually a working class average Joe.

12
00:49:48,000 --> 00:49:54,000
If the final remaining woman still accepted the bachelor after
learning about the ruse, the two split a $1,000,000 reward.

13
00:53:57,000 --> 00:54:03,000
The series was hosted by American television presenter Alex McLeod.

14
00:58:06,000 --> 00:58:12,000
The first season of Joe Millionaire experienced high success in ratings, with its season finale being the highest-rated
entertainment program (excluding Super Bowl lead-out programs) aired on network television since 2000.

15
01:02:15,000 --> 01:02:21,000
The second season, titled The Next Joe Millionaire,
experienced disappointing ratings throughout its run.

16
01:06:24,000 --> 01:06:30,000
In 2005, Joe Millionaire and The Next Joe Millionaire were among several television programs cited in a
class-action lawsuit filed by the Writers Guild of America concerning labor law violations.

17
01:10:33,000 --> 01:10:39,000
In November 2021, Fox announced a revival entitled Joe Millionaire: For
Richer or Poorer, which aired from January 6 to March 10, 2022.

18
01:14:42,000 --> 01:14:48,000
The revival featured two bachelors, one a working-class
man and the other a secret millionaire.

19
01:18:51,000 --> 01:18:57,000
The tone is emotional.
